land-water-eval notice
=======================

The files `data/land_water_gt_2deg.csv` and the ground-truth panel in
`figures/land_water_comparison.*` are derived from the intermediate-resolution
GSHHS shoreline component of the Global Self-consistent, Hierarchical,
High-resolution Geography Database (GSHHG).

Source and attribution
----------------------

GSHHG is maintained by Paul Wessel and Walter H. F. Smith. NOAA/NCEI describes
it as WGS84 geographic data made from hierarchical closed polygons, including
land/ocean, lake/land, and island-in-lake/lake boundaries:

https://www.ngdc.noaa.gov/mgg/shorelines/shorelines.html

The upstream source distribution is:

https://github.com/GenericMappingTools/gshhg-gmt

Please cite:

Wessel, P., and W. H. F. Smith (1996), A global, self-consistent,
hierarchical, high-resolution shoreline database, Journal of Geophysical
Research, 101(B4), 8741-8743, https://doi.org/10.1029/96JB00104.

